# Build context privacy and development caches.
**/.git
**/.agents
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/tests
**/test_*.py
**/logs
**/backups
**/sessions
**/auth_info*
**/credentials.json
**/cookies*.txt
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Exclude private files regardless of capitalization.
**/.[eE][nN][vV]*
**/*[sS][eE][cC][rR][eE][tT]*
**/*[cC][rR][eE][dD][eE][nN][tT][iI][aA][lL]*
**/*.[pP][eE][mM]
**/*.[kK][eE][yY]
**/*.[pP]12
**/*.[pP][fF][xX]
